=== D. Domination-partition degraded exponent c(1-c) fixed point ===
c=1/8 -> c(1-c)=7/64=0.109375<1/8; iterate c_{k+1}=c_k(1-c_k)->0
needed split factor f with f^c>=1/2 (to keep 2 f^c>=1 at c=1/8): f>=0.003906=2^-8=1/256
i.e. type-controlled pair with gamma>=1/256 each side suffices for 1/8; gamma=1/50 qualifies WITH type control
=== E. Additive +1 compensation windows ===
